  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär lär kɛ kui̱ jiäkni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän göörä ɣöö bia jɛ ŋa̱c, dämaari, ɛn ɣöö te gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn diaal bo̱th ɛ pua̱a̱r, kä ci kɛn diaal rët kɛ bar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cua kɛn diaal lak ala ji̱ kɔaar Muthɛ piny puɔ̱rä kɛnɛ rɛy bar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn diaal mi̱eth yieekä kɛl cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn diaal maath kɛ pi̱ yieekä mɔ kɛl ɔ. Cikɛ maath kä päm yieekä min cikɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r, ɛn päm ɛmɔ ɛ jɛn Kritho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cäŋ ɛ jɛn inɔ, cu Kuoth lɔcdɛ jiääk kɛ ri̱wdiɛn ti ŋuan, kä cuɛ ri̱ŋkiɛn riaw där dɔaar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu ti̱ti̱ tuɔɔk kɛ ala luëëk kɛ kui̱dan, kɛ ɣöö /canɛ ciaŋ ti jiäk bi go̱r ce̱tkɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ kuth baaŋ pal ce̱tkɛ mëë ci tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn ɛ la̱t, ce̱tkɛ min ca gɔ̱r i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 32:6.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ci naath nyuur, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ mi̱th kä bikɛ maath, kä cukɛ rɔ̱ jiɛc kɛ ɣöö bikɛ duth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarnɛ duer lät kɛ leer ce̱tkɛ min ci tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn ɛ la̱t, kä cu nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn rɛw wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k li̱w kɛ jɛn cäŋɔ kɛlɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cuarnɛ Kuäär ni Kuoth ɣɔ̱n, ce̱tkɛ mëë ci tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn ɛ la̱t, kä cua kɛ däk ɛ thɔ̱ɔ̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cuarnɛ go̱o̱ny, ce̱tkɛ mëë ci tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn ɛ la̱t kä cua kɛ däk ɛ Dääk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ti̱ti̱ tuɔɔk kä kɛ ala luek, kä cua kɛ gɔ̱a̱r piny kɛ kui̱ ŋi̱i̱cädan, kɔn nɛy ti ci guut thiak kɛ ben. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi caari jɛ ɛn ɣöö bumi, ku rɔ tit, kɛ ɣöö /ci bi tɛɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ ɣɔ̱n mi ci ben kä yɛ, mi /ken tuɔɔk kä nɛy diaal. Kuoth ɛ gua̱n ŋäthä, kä /cɛ yɛ bi pa̱l ɣöö ba yɛ ɣɔam kɛ buɔ̱m mi leny buɔ̱mdun. Kä mi wa yɛ ɣɔam bɛ yɛ moc duɔ̱ɔ̱p känä, kɛ ɣöö bia jɛ luäŋ kɛ ruɔ̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, dämaari, nɔ̱a̱nɛ rɔ̱ kä pal kuthni jiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruacä ce̱tkɛ mi ruacä kɛ nɛy ti tekɛ ca̱r, yɛn pua̱nykun luɔ̱kɛ mɔ cä la̱r yɛ mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liɛɛr puthä min puɔthnɛ /ciɛ nyuaak kɛ riɛm Kritho? Kä juray in puɔ̱nynɛ /ciɛ nyuaak kɛ puɔ̱ny Kritho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö te ni juray kɛl thi̱n, kɔn nɛy ti ŋuan ti̱ti̱ lapnɛ puɔ̱ny kɛl, kɛ ɣöö canɛ nyuak ni ɛn juray ɔ kɛlɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Carɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, nɛy tin camkɛ muc tin thöpkɛ Kuoth /cikɛ a mät guäth mucä? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋu mi luɔtdä? Ɛ ɣöö ɛn mi̱eth in ca thöp kuth baaŋ tëëkɛ luɔt, kiɛ jɛn kuoth baaŋ puɔ̱nydɛ tee luɔt ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ëëy, ɣän luɔtdä ni ɣöö, min tho̱p nɛy ti kueckɛ Kuoth ɛ, thöpkɛ jɛ kuth ti jiäk, a /ci mɔ a Kuoth. Kä /cä jɛ go̱r ɛn ɣöö dërɛ rɔ̱ mat kɛ kuth ti jiäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn /cia dee maath kɛ liɛɛr Kua̱r ni Yecu kä bia maath kɛ liɛɛr kuthni ti jiäk. Kä /cia dee mat guäth mi̱eth Kua̱r ni Yecu kɛnɛ gua̱a̱th mi̱eth kuthni ti jiäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiɛ görnɛ ɣöö bi Kuäär ni Kuoth tekɛ tiɛɛl? Kä car nɛ jɛ bum ni kɔn kä jɛ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋäc ciɛŋä gɔɔyä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋɔaani diaal luɔtkɛ rɔ̱, kä /cikɛ ŋɔak diaal gɔw tɔ̱. Ŋɔaani diaal luɔtkɛ rɔ̱, kä /cikɛ ŋɔak diaal lua̱kɛ naath tɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A raan /ci go̱r ni mi gɔaa kɛ kui̱dɛ, a jɛ go̱o̱r ni mi gɔaa kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni kɔ̱kiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Camɛ ri̱ŋɔ kɔakɛ guäth ko̱kä mɔ, a thil thiec kɛ kui̱ cärä lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 24:1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “piny ɛ duŋ Kua̱r ni Kuoth amäni ŋɔaani diaal tin te rɛydɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ca yɛ cɔl ɛ nɛy ti /ci Kuɔth ŋäth, kä nhɔakɛ wä, camɛ mɔ ca kuëŋ nhiamdun ɔ a thil thiec kɛ kui̱ cärä lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci raan yɛ jiök i̱, “Mɛmɛ ca thöp ala muc kɛ kui̱ kuɔth,” ɛnɔ /cuarɛ jɛ cam, kɛ kui̱ raam in ci jɛ kɛnɛ kui̱ cärä lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän luɔtdä ni ca̱r lɔaac raam ɛmɔ, a /ci mɔ a ca̱r lɔaacdun inɔ dɔ̱ŋ dee raan thiec i̱, “Kɛ kui̱ ŋukä bä ciaaŋdä päl kɛ kui̱ cärä lɔaac raam mi dɔ̱diɛn ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi mi̱ethä kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac, ɛŋu bä ɣä lat jɔ̱ɔ̱r ɔ kɛ kui̱ kä mi cä Kuoth la̱t tɛ̈th lɔaac kɛ jɛ?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
